  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temp Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Convert</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"result\">Result</label>\n      <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C→F: x × 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F→C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2d2f45;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, 'Segoe UI', monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f1018;\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }\nlabel { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }\ninput, select, button, output {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  background: #1a1c2c;\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\ninput:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #fff;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ffe08a; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: none; }\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  min-height: 2.4em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n.formula {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-align: center;\n  border-top: 2px dashed var(--muted);\n  padding-top: 12px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const input = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst direction = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = input.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const x = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(x)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let out;\n  if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\ninput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Temperature Converter\n\nA single-page, offline temperature converter with a pixel-inspired look.\n\n## Features\n- Convert Celsius → Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Convert Fahrenheit → Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n- Output formatted to exactly two decimals, no units.\n- Empty, non-numeric, or non-finite input shows `Error`.\n- Keyboard accessible: press Enter in the input to convert.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n\n## Usage\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No build step or server required.\n\n## Files\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `style.css` – pixel theme\n- `script.js` – conversion logic\n\n## Error Behavior\nIf the input is empty, contains letters, or evaluates to `NaN`/`Infinity`, the result displays exactly `Error`.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
